-17-pro-dark-blue-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone pro dark blue\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":287,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":9588,\"date\":\"2025-09-13T01:50:42+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2025-09-12T23:50:42+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-air-iphone-17-e-iphone-17-pro-disponibili-per-pre-ordine\",\"title\":\"iPhone Air, iPhone 17 e iPhone 17 Pro Disponibili per Pre-Ordine\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha avviato i pre-ordini per i nuovi modelli di iPhone, inclusi iPhone Air, iPhone 17 e iPhone 17 Pro, disponibili in oltre 50 paesi.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2025/09/iphone-air-thinness-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iphone air thinness\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":224,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":9421,\"date\":\"2025-09-10T14:14:28+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2025-09-10T12:14:28+00:00\",\"slug\":\"nuovi-modelli-iphone-fotocamera-18mp\",\"title\":\"Tutti i nuovi modelli di iPhone presentano una fotocamera frontale da 18MP con Center Stage e sensore quadrato\",\"excerpt\":\"Tutti i nuovi modelli di iPhone di Apple sono dotati di una fotocamera frontale da 18 megapixel significativamente migliorata, con Center Stage e un sensore quadrato.\",\"categoryName\":\"iPhone\",\"categorySlug\":\"iphone\",\"categoryId\":4,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2025/09/18-mp-front-facing-camera-768x431.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"mp front facing camera\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a048